msgid "Workflow"
msgstr "گردش کار"

msgid ""
"Record-triggered workflow rules with field conditions, immediate actions "
"(update field, assign task, email, notification), and time-based triggers "
"scheduled relative to record or rule dates."
msgstr ""
"قوانین گردش کار مبتنی بر رکورد با شرایط فیلد، اقدامات فوری (به‌روزرسانی "
"فیلد، تخصیص وظیفه، ایمیل، اعلان) و محرک‌های مبتنی بر زمان که نسبت به "
"تاریخ‌های رکورد یا قانون زمان‌بندی می‌شوند."

msgid ""
"Re-raise HttpNotFound with exception chaining in workflow detail views to "
"preserve context."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Migrated workflow execution engine transaction imports from django.db to "
"horilla.db."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Migrated signal imports to the horilla.db.models.signals shim and "
"standardized first-party import groups; behavior unchanged."
msgstr ""
"واردات سیگنال به شیم horilla.db.models.signals مهاجرت داده شد و گروه‌های "
"واردات طرف اول استاندارد شدند؛ رفتار بدون تغییر."

#| msgid ""
#| "Workflow automation engine: WorkflowRule / WorkflowCondition / "
#| "WorkflowAction models, dynamic condition evaluation, immediate dispatch on "
#| "record saves, Celery WorkflowTimeTriggerAction and "
#| "ScheduledWorkflowExecution, execution history modal, FilterSet support, "
#| "auto-registration for workflow-enabled CRM models (leads, accounts, "
#| "campaigns, contacts, opportunities), modular views, hidden-field action "
#| "configuration fixes, restored workflow detail pages, and improved routing "
#| "namespaces."
msgid ""
"Workflow automation engine: WorkflowRule / WorkflowCondition / "
"WorkflowAction models, dynamic condition evaluation, immediate dispatch on "
"record saves, Celery WorkflowTimeTriggerAction and "
"ScheduledWorkflowExecution, execution history modal, FilterSet support, "
"auto-registration for workflow-enabled models via feature registration (e.g."
" users, departments, holidays), modular views, hidden-field action "
"configuration fixes, restored workflow detail pages, and improved routing "
"namespaces."
msgstr ""
"موتور اتوماسیون گردش کار: مدل‌های WorkflowRule / WorkflowCondition / "
"WorkflowAction، ارزیابی شرایط پویا، ارسال فوری در ذخیره رکورد، "
"WorkflowTimeTriggerAction سلری و ScheduledWorkflowExecution، مودال تاریخچه "
"اجرا، پشتیبانی FilterSet، ثبت خودکار برای مدل‌های CRM فعال گردش کار "
"(سرنخ‌ها، حساب‌ها، کمپین‌ها، مخاطبین، فرصت‌ها)، نمایش‌های ماژولار، اصلاحات "
"پیکربندی اقدام فیلد پنهان، بازیابی صفحات جزئیات گردش کار و فضای نام "
"مسیر‌یابی بهبود یافته."

msgid ""
"WorkflowRuleForm aligned with HorillaModelForm layout: field_order, "
"Meta.fields = \"__all__\", and keep_on_form for is_active; action forms "
"unchanged."
msgstr ""
"WorkflowRuleForm با چیدمان HorillaModelForm هماهنگ شد: field_order، "
"Meta.fields = \"__all__\" و keep_on_form برای is_active؛ فرم‌های اقدام بدون "
"تغییر."

#| msgid ""
#| "Initial release: workflow rules per ContentType with create/edit triggers, "
#| "AND/OR conditions, ordered immediate actions, time-trigger actions with "
#| "Celery scheduling and execution history, Settings → Automations → Workflow "
#| "Rules, and integration with registered CRM models via feature registration."
msgid ""
"Initial release: workflow rules per ContentType with create/edit triggers, "
"AND/OR conditions, ordered immediate actions, time-trigger actions with "
"Celery scheduling and execution history, Settings → Automations → Workflow "
"Rules, and integration with registered models via feature registration."
msgstr ""
"انتشار اولیه: قوانین گردش کار در هر ContentType با محرک‌های ایجاد/ویرایش، "
"شرایط AND/OR، اقدامات فوری مرتب، اقدامات محرک زمانی با زمان‌بندی سلری و "
"تاریخچه اجرا، Settings → Automations → Workflow Rules و یکپارچه‌سازی با "
"مدل‌های CRM ثبت شده از طریق ثبت ویژگی."

